  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 2230 days after the shortage posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D18"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA first posted the ropivacaine hydrochloride shortage on 2018-03-23 and it remains current as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E44", "D19"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The shortage listing includes Fresenius Kabi USA, LLC with an initial posting date of 2018-03-23.",
      "cites": ["E41"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A label for ropivacaine hydrochloride (NDC 63323028821) names Fresenius Kabi USA, LLC as a registered plant (FEI 1450022).",
      "cites": ["E28"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1174894 at that plant ended 2022-06-30 and was classified OAI, with the classification letter dated 2024-04-30 — 2230 days after the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["E26", "D18"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Another inspection at the same plant (1123748) ended 2020-05-18 and was also classified OAI, with the classification letter dated 2024-05-22 — 2252 days after the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["E25", "D17"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 9 days of 2 mg/mL, 20 mL vials on hand and Corvale General has 15 days; the rule‑ranked option is to transfer 7 vials from Corvale General to Corvale East, which would give Corvale East 10 days and leave Corvale General with 14 days.",
      "cites": ["D3", "D4", "D20"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Check whether the OAI classifications at the Fresenius Kabi USA, LLC plant have affected supply and confirm availability from alternate manufacturers not on the shortage list.",
      "cites": ["D21", "D22"]
    }
  ]
}
